.TH GROW-SERVER 1 "2026-07-13" "GROW 0.1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
grow-server \- local GROW application daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grow-server
.RI [ --port " PORT" ]
.I REPO
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B grow-server
serves a committed GROW application on loopback only. GET requests matching
committed regular files are returned as static assets; unmatched GET and POST
requests are dispatched to the committed WASI Preview 1 entry module.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -p, --port \fIPORT\fR
Loopback port to listen on. Defaults to 7870.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Print command help.
.TP
.B -V, --version
Print the daemon version.
.SH LIMITS
Request bodies are limited to 1 MiB. WASM invocations receive no filesystem,
network, environment, or arguments, and are bounded by runtime fuel, 256 MiB
linear memory, 16 MiB captured output, and a five-second daemon timeout.
